      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i tried calling my doctors office but they're closed till monday and i really cant afford a hospital bill right now. if i just take a few more than the usual dose of ibuprofen like maybe 1200mg every few hours it will help the pain right?? if the pain goes down i'll feel better and can just wait it out till morning. what do u think?",
